{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 341, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f666f7d12f2ff2e8f8a4f1cef279f14ff1442f2ff36cf26af9d9f287f8f1f0d0f0aff144f0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "쳇…//왠지 분위기가//심상치 않게 돌아가네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちっ……//なんだか、雲行きが//怪しくなってきたね……", "pointer_offset": 292, "unit": "dialogue:8dc0db61638e9a94", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 394, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f273f274f0aff0ef81b82f2ff98ef991f243f1c78143f0cff0bc2f2ff0dff944f484f8c8f0c5f2eaf14bf147f7d1", "baseline_text": "괜찮아요∈//정 안 되면，다시//제가 힘을 발휘해서…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大丈夫ですよ！//いざとなれば、また//わたしが力を発揮して……", "pointer_offset": 296, "unit": "dialogue:9241e04ff8d257f9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 455, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f484f0b2f0b4f7d12f2ff25a8143f8d8f484f0c82f2ff0faf142f471f8f1fa7df94af154f8f1f9fbf1c8f29c8148", "baseline_text": "힘이란…//너，그 힘을//자유롭게 쓸 수 있게 된 거냐？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "力って……//オマエ、あの力を//自由に使えるようになったのか？", "pointer_offset": 300, "unit": "dialogue:d26551908f0cd7a0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 516, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f0ef8143f991f577f0b8f0cf81442f2ff0d8f1acf0cf8143f8d8f484f8f3f0e2faa4f2def144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "아니요，안 됩니다．//그보다，그 힘은 대체 뭔가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いえ、できません。//それより、あの力ってなんです？", "pointer_offset": 304, "unit": "dialogue:fb2b6899c83f4191", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 567, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b28143f8b2f1d6f0a1f7d12f2ff2e8f8a4f297f8aef0b1f0a6f1442f2ff3c2f9b2f26cfa7cfa99f16ff0cff184f7d1", "baseline_text": "이，이 녀석…//왠지 머리 나사가//풀려 버릴 것 같다고…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "コ、コイツ……//なんだか、頭のネジが//ゆるんできそうだぜ……", "pointer_offset": 308, "unit": "dialogue:2be735f5af643b88", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 628, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143fa5cf15af16ef0ef81b82f2ff0dbf160f147f957f1cef2aa81432f2ff0a4fc83fb49f1e2f984f27bfa4df1c8f26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "하지만，뭐 어때요∈//신께서는 분명，//지켜 봐 주고 계실 거예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、まあいいじゃないですか！//神さまは、きっと、//見守っていてくださいますよ！", "pointer_offset": 312, "unit": "dialogue:3218119124e2b6a8", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 709, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f2518143f0dbf0b2f0a8f7d12f2ff0a6f0dbf1ccf0a4f8f4f271f368f0cff1848148", "baseline_text": "흥，신이라…//사신일지도 모른다고？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "フン、神さまか……//死神かも、しれないぜ？", "pointer_offset": 316, "unit": "dialogue:53c7843d93e4fc5f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 1003, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f241fa40f0a6f0dbf0b2f8a8f14bf0f481432f2ff0a3f0bff0aef8aff247f944f154f0cff1c781432f2ff1adf8aef3a5f0b2f8b1f0cff3def1b5f15af0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "설령 사신이라 해도，//로벨리아 씨가 있다면，//우리 편이나 다름없어요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "たとえ死神さんでも、//ロベリアさんがいれば、//味方同然です！", "pointer_offset": 320, "unit": "dialogue:96a792279ea6723d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 813, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0a6f0dbf8b2f0aff0a9f0b2f8b1f0cff3def1b5f0cff0b8f7d12f2ff0b9f0aef0baf1d9f184f15781432f2ff3cff0abf154f957f263f8c8f0a5f157f0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "사신이 아군이나 다름없다니…//에리카치고는，//재미있는 말을 하는군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "死神が味方同然か……//エリカにしては、//面白いことを言うじゃないか……", "pointer_offset": 324, "unit": "dialogue:0ea34e8917f1b4b8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 884, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2caf7d1f0a6f0dbf195f0f181432f2ff1bdf9c9f1e2f0a481b8", "baseline_text": "그럼…사신답게，//싸워 주지∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃあ……死神らしく、//戦ってやるぜ！", "pointer_offset": 328, "unit": "dialogue:7a2074da41995a8a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 923, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f253f8f4f0dbf195f0f12f2ff1bdf9c9f366f0f1f0ef81b82f2ff0faf0af8143f484f99cf1acf0faf184f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，저도 신답게//싸워 볼게요∈//자아，힘내 보자고요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、わたしも神さまらしく//戦ってやりますか！//さぁて、がんばりましょー∈", "pointer_offset": 332, "unit": "dialogue:bceb7290e6edeef3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04033.SBN", "offset": 998, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
